E.1.3 Step 2.3: Create and Manage the Session
If the credentials are valid, the Servlet should:

Create (or obtain) an HTTP session: HttpSession session = request.getSession(true);
Store the authenticated user’s identity in the session: session.setAttribute("UserName", user);
Respond with HTTP 200 and a confirmation JSON body

